  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed single storey rear extension when viewed in conjunction with the existing single storey side/rear infill extension would extend beyond the rear wall of the original dwellinghouse by more than 6 metre and extend beyond a side wall and be more than half the width of the original dwelling, contrary to the conditions (g)(j) and (ja) under Class A. The proposal therefore would not constitute permitted development by virtue of Article 3, Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).\r\rShould the applicant wish to proceed with the proposed extension, a full planning application will be required.\r\rTherefore, it is recommended that Prior Approval is REFUSED.\r"
